<p align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">белгиланиши</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="71%">
<p align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">таърифи</span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">1.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Вақт</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">T</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Секунд</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">s</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">секунд — цезий резонанси (Δ<i>ν</i><sub>Cs</sub>)частотасининг қайдланган сонли қийматини, цезий 133 атоми асосий ҳолатининг қўзғалмаган ўта юпқа ўтиш частотасини </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">герц бирликларида 9 192631 770 га тенг қабул қилиш орқали аниқланади, бу ерда герц s<sup>-1</sup>га мос.<br /><br /></span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">2.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Узунлик </span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">L</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Метр</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">m</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">метр — вакуумда <i>c</i> ёруғлик тезлигининг қайдланган сонли қийматини m/s бирликларида 299 792 458 га тенг қабул қилиш йўли билан аниқланади.</span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">3.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Масса</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">M</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Килограмм</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">kg</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">килограмм — Планк доимийсининг (h) қайдланган сонли қийматини J∙s бирликларида 6,62 607 015×10<sup>-34</sup><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> га</span><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> тенг қабул қилиш йўли билан аниқланади.</span></span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">4.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Электр токи <br />(электр токи кучи) </span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">I</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Ампер</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">А</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">ампер — элементар заряднинг (e)қайдланган сонли қийматини C бирликларида 1,602 176 634×10<sup>-19</sup><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> га</span><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> тенг қабул қилиш йўли билан аниқланади.</span></span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">5.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Термодинамик ҳарорат<a href="http://lex.uz/docs/3499851#5917109">*</a></span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Θ</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Кельвин</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">K</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">кельвин — Больцман доимийсининг (<i>k) </i>қайдланган сонли қийматини J∙K<sup>-1 </sup>бирликларида 1,380 649×10<sup>-23</sup><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> га</span><span style="VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline"> тенг қабул қилиш йўли билан аниқланади.</span></span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">6.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="12%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Модда миқдори</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">N</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="4%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">Моль</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="5%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">mоl</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="71%">
<p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">моль — тизимнинг таркибида роппа-роса 6,022 140 76×10<sup>23 </sup>тузилма объектлари бўлган модда миқдори. Бу сон Авогадро доимийсининг қайдланган сонли қиймати ҳисобланади (<i>N</i><sub>A</sub>).<br /><br /></span></p></td></tr>
<tr style="HEIGHT: 1cm">
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 1cm" valign="top" width="1%">
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">7.</span></p></td>
