<p style="TEXT-INDENT: -2.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify"><span>1 B = lg (P<sub>2</sub>/P<sub>1</sub>) <br /><br /><br /></span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: -2.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify"><span>P<sub>2 </sub>= 10 P<sub>1</sub> бўлганда,<br /><br /><br /></span></p>
